{
  "name": "cashwerk – Deal Won → Create Invoice",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Deal Won → Create Invoice\nWhen a deal in the sales pipeline is marked **WON**, this workflow loads the deal's contact and creates a draft invoice in cashwerk, titled after the deal.\n\n## Setup\n1. Add your cashwerk API credential to all cashwerk nodes.\n2. Activate the workflow – the trigger registers its webhook in cashwerk automatically.\n3. Optional: extend the *Create Invoice* node with invoice lines (Additional Fields → Invoice Lines).\n\n_Needs the **cashwerk** community node (`n8n-nodes-cashwerk`) and a cashwerk API key (cashwerk → Settings → API Platform)._",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "deal.update"
        ]
      },
      "id": "n2",
      "name": "cashwerk Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cashwerk.cashwerkTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "",
      "credentials": {
        "cashwerkApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "cashwerk API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "n3",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.completionStatus }}",
              "rightValue": "WON",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n4",
      "name": "Deal Won?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "apiKey",
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "get",
        "contactId": "={{ $json.data.contactId }}"
      },
      "id": "n5",
      "name": "Get Contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cashwerk.cashwerk",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "cashwerkApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "cashwerk API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "apiKey",
        "resource": "invoice",
        "operation": "create",
        "invoice": "={{ JSON.stringify({ title: \"Invoice – \" + $('cashwerk Trigger').item.json.data.title }) }}",
        "customer": "={{ JSON.stringify({ clientType: \"CONTACT\", clientId: $json.id }) }}"
      },
      "id": "n6",
      "name": "Create Invoice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cashwerk.cashwerk",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        800,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "cashwerkApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "cashwerk API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "n7",
      "name": "Not Won – Skip",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        420
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "cashwerk Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Deal Won?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Deal Won?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get Contact",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Not Won – Skip",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get Contact": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Invoice",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateId": "cashwerk-deal-won-to-invoice",
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "cashwerk"
    },
    {
      "name": "sales"
    },
    {
      "name": "invoicing"
    }
  ]
}
